			shouldMatch:  true,
		},
	}
	for _, test := range tests {
		t.Run(test.title, func(t *testing.T) {
			testRoute(t, test)
			testTemplate(t, test)
		})
	}
}

func TestPath(t *testing.T) {
	tests := []routeTest{
		{
			title:       "Path route, match",
